{"completed": true, "response": "<WritingBlock id=\"48317\" variant=\"standard\">他和这个人本来就相处得很自在，这段关系也很值得珍惜，所以现在的亲近不是他凭空想出来的，而是真实存在、也能让他感到快乐的。他已经默默在意对方一段时间了，这份喜欢让原本熟悉的相处有了更深的意义。他想再靠近一点，却又怕说出心意会改变两人现在的关系，所以他一直把喜欢藏在这份亲近里，没有表白，也没有提出要求。正因为他真心享受现在的美好，又舍不得冒险失去它，所以开心之中也带着一点不舍，即使还没有失去什么，他也已经开始在意这份自在能不能一直保持下去。此刻，他不需要想出办法或作出决定，只是因为心里有了这份喜欢，眼前原本就很好的相处变得更加珍贵，而没说出口的期待和顾虑也依然同时存在。</WritingBlock>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b5276ae3-d1be-4af1-a2f0-59f5571064c1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002932917943Z", "elapsed_seconds": 9.891, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:29:42.804876+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "67f714368feeda14083e2e0a7091b4ad481a200c1c8fb3a40d2cef68232c58f6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offli